        "http://localhost:3000",
        "http://localhost:5173"
      ],
      "placement": {
        "mode": "inline",
        "position": "centered",
        "opening_prompt": "Hi — I'm the Space Rising website EA. I know the SRW mission, the 8 pages live at /srw, and what's still open (team photos, sponsor logos, source links, event dates). What are we working on?",
